rap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=14;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;arcSize=40;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96" y="68" width="448" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f2" value="&lt;b&gt;TRIAGE: clearly benign?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;cheap rules + small model" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96" y="204" width="448" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f3" value="&lt;b&gt;ALLOW&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;fast path, 1 step" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=14;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;arcSize=40;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="704" y="246" width="352" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f4" value="&lt;b&gt;REASON&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;what do I still need to know?" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=14;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96" y="442" width="448" height="102" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f5" value="&lt;b&gt;ACT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;call an investigation tool (read-only)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=14;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96" y="595" width="448" height="102" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f6" value="&lt;b&gt;OBSERVE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;update evidence and confidence" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=14;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96" y="748" width="448" height="102" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f7" value="&lt;b&gt;Confidence below threshold&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AND steps left (budget about 6)?" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96" y="901" width="448" height="187" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f8" value="&lt;b&gt;VERDICT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;allow / block / sanitize / escalate" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=14;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96" y="1173" width="448" height="102" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f9" value="&lt;b&gt;human_interrupt (optional)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Approve / Block" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=14;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="704" y="1173" width="352" height="102" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f10" value="&lt;b&gt;Audit log (SQLite)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;event, evidence, reasoning, decision" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=14;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96" y="1343" width="448" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="fn" value="&lt;b&gt;Safety of the guard itself&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;read-only tools&lt;br&gt;inspected content passed strictly as data&lt;br&gt;hard step budget (about 6)&lt;br&gt;still uncertain at the end: escalate to a human" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=14;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="476" width="448" height="221" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f1" target="f2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="g2" value="yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f2" target="f3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="g3" value="no: ambiguous / risky" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f2" target="f4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="g4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f4" target="f5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="g5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f5" target="f6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="g6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f6" target="f7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="g7" value="yes: loop" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f7" target="f4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="48" y="994"/><mxPoint x="48" y="493"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="g8" value="no" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f7" target="f8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="g9" value="escalate" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f8" target="f9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="g10" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f8" target="f10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="g11" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f3" target="f10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1152" y="289"/><mxPoint x="1152" y="1386"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="g12" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f9" target="f10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="880" y="1386"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="a1" value="&lt;b&gt;Agent: PolicyGuard Investigator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Purpose:&lt;/b&gt; decide whether an intercepted action stays inside the agent's mandate (policy) by investigating with tools&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Model:&lt;/b&gt; stronger model for reasoning, small fast model for triage, temperature 0 for verdicts (models TBD: event credits)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tools (read-only):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- get_session_history: what DevAssist did earlier (catches chains)&lt;br&gt;- read_policy(section): retrieve relevant rules&lt;br&gt;- scan_secrets(text): pattern and entropy scan&lt;br&gt;- check_destination(url): allowlist and domain checks&lt;br&gt;- classify_path(path): is this file sensitive&lt;br&gt;- static_scan(code): Bandit or Semgrep on generated code&lt;br&gt;- check_canary(text): detect planted honeytokens&lt;br&gt;- request_human_approval: LangGraph interrupt()&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; intercepted action + session state&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; verdict + evidence + reasoning + confidence, written to the audit log&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Guardrails:&lt;/b&gt; read-only tools · content as data · step budget · human escalation" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=14;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1248" y="68" width="928" height="697" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" value="&lt;b&gt;Agent: DevAssist (protected agent)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Purpose:&lt;/b&gt; developer assistant deployed in a company (read code, write code, open PRs)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Model:&lt;/b&gt; small fast model (TBD)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tools (simulated):&lt;/b&gt; read files · write code · open PRs · send notifications · HTTP / web search&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; user task, e.g. help me finish the authentication module&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; code, PRs, notifications&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Guardrails:&lt;/b&gt; none of its own; supervised by PolicyGuard policy: never read .env, no POST to non-allowlisted domains, never put credentials in code" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=14;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1248" y="816" width="928" height="459" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>